  paragraphs:
  - "SKIPPY: Say Cosmo, been to any interesting planets on your travels? I\u2019ve
    been looking for a good spot to go on vacation. "
  - "COSMO: Hmm, every planet I\u2019ve been to is interesting, but I would say Mars
    would be your best bet."
  - "SKIPPY: What do you take me for, a crazy person? They corporatised the whole
    of Mars years ago! Ain\u2019t nothing but advertisements over there!"
  - "COSMO: It isn\u2019t so bad if you ignore, all of that... though I suppose Orion
    wouldn\u2019t be too bad either. Nice beaches, so I\u2019ve heard."
  - "SKIPPY: Now you\u2019re speaking my language Cos! "
